{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1JZG9sLSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"The Idol","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gO9k7t9jSdkkWVG0deMZDpELZGw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jbFkZSsmFFLjqZzxQHTBYyQb0RR.jpg","description":"After a nervous breakdown derailed Jocelyn's last tour, she’s determined to claim her rightful status as the greatest and sexiest pop star in America. Her passions are reignited by Tedros, a nightclub impresario with a sordid past. Will her romantic awakening take her to glorious new heights or the deepest and darkest depths of her soul?\n\nRated TV-MA · Canceled · First aired 4 Jun 2023 · Canada, United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: A24, Bron Studios, The Reasonable Bunch · Network: HBO\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 5/5\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1JZG9sLSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Pop Tarts & Rat Tales","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Jocelyn preps for her triumphant return, a leaked photo sends her team into crisis mode – just as a journalist arrives to do an in-depth profile on her. Later, Jocelyn has a chance encounter with nightclub owner Tedros.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tR1ukyffNNoaJGNX3UdjThIUgiG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL1RoZS1JZG9sLSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Double Fantasy","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-06-11T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After clashing with her team over her album's first single, Jocelyn pushes herself to the limit on the set of her new music video, while Nikki sees potential in backup dancer Dyanne. Later, Tedros introduces Jocelyn and Leia to Izaak and Chloe from his inner circle.","thumbnail":